.SH PORTABILITY
Applications employing
.I \%ncurses
extensions should condition their use on the visibility of the
.B \%NCURSES_VERSION
preprocessor macro.
.PP
NetBSD
.I curses
adopted
.I \%wresize
in 2001 (release 1.5.3),
and
.I \%PDCurses
in 2004 (version 2.7).
.PP
It is not possible to resize windows with SVr4
.IR curses "."
